<title>UK: SEK adds 5.0 billion peseta to August 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>SEK adds 5.0 billion peseta to August 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been ioncreased by joint lead managers Union Bank of Switzerland and Banco Santander de Negocios.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT   *15 BLN PTA    COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    08.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.38    PAY DATE  **11.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     MOODY	AA3	 S&amp;P	   AA+</p>
<p> NOTES     *INCREASED WITH THE LAUNCH OF A NEW TRANCHE OF 5.0</p>
<p>		BILLION PESETA.</p>
<p>	    **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
